title: "Singapore / Johor Bahru 15-Minute City Explorer"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible street-network study of walkable access to everyday essentials in Singapore and
  Johor Bahru, with scenario models for the RTS Link, shared autonomous feeders and the conversion
  of car-park land into neighbourhood hubs.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SG/JB 15-Minute City Explorer contributors"
